ey don't get it they think  they're happy and they think they love  america and they think they have a good  life  and they think their ancestors came here  for a reason but they're wrong it's  actually all  terrible it's be miserable be miserable  like me that's what he's telling them  i hope you enjoyed that short segment  from the michael knowles show be sure to  check out the full  episode linked in the description or  download the podcast  wherever you listen to podcasts  [Music]  you

